---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Preview & Split View">
  <h1>Preview & split view</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Writer supports a full Markdown preview and an editor + preview split view with scroll sync.
  </p>

  <h2>Preview engine</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Markdown rendering via <code>react-markdown</code> with GitHub Flavored Markdown.</li>
    <li>Syntax-highlighted code blocks.</li>
    <li>Mermaid diagrams (<code>```mermaid</code> fences).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Scroll sync</h2>
  <p class="muted">When split view is enabled, the editor and preview keep position aligned.</p>
</DocsLayout>

